1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
How many passes?
Count to the end!

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:06,030
Count only the passes of the mint ball.
Ignore the coral ball!

3
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:22,800
Mint passes: one · two · …

4
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:25,170
How many mint passes did you count?

5
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,140
The answer is 11!

6
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,910
But… did you see
the big star?

7
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:36,680
Let's watch again, fast

8
00:00:36,730 --> 00:00:38,850
A star walked right
through the middle!

9
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,050
Your brain shines a spotlight
only on what you focus on

10
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,620
Things outside the spotlight reach your eyes
but barely stick in your mind

11
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:47,420
This is called "inattentional blindness"

12
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:51,790
If you look at your phone while walking,
you might miss a car or a bike

13
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:54,240
Focus is powerful,
but it makes you miss things too

14
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:56,940
Numbers · pictures · passes —
how many fooled you?
